*                                                                          *
*   Author(s)     : Louis T Steinhil                                       *
*   Last Modified : 2026-08-01                                             *
*                                                                          *
*   Description   : Adds a QJS-only, client-native Auto Combat settings    *
*                   preview to the 2025-07-16 Ragexe. Persistent controls  *
*                   are created by the normal in-game UI render pass;     *
*                   /autohunt only opens or closes the settings window.   *
*                   470x346 UIFrameWnd on the game UI thread, preserving   *
*                   native focus, hit testing, drag capture, and window    *
*                   ownership. Its native canvas loads the supplied Global *
*                   AutoHunt BMPs and exposes Basic, Monster, three Skill, *
*                   two Potion, two Looting, Move, and Item pages.         *
*                   Separate draggable AutoBattle and AutoSupport controls  *
*                   play baked frames from the supplied native STR effects *
*                   and send independent server-authoritative mutations.   *
*                   Skill pages 1 and 2 accept the stock Skill Tree's      *
*                   native drag payload for attack and support slots. It   *
*                   sends 0x0BF8/AHUI requests and receives snapshots      *
*                   multiplexed through 0x0BEF. AHUI and PINC coexist      *
*                   without a DLL or client-side combat logic.             *
*                                                                          *
\**************************************************************************/

